@startuml
title Revisi Sequence Diagram — Pembaruan Konten CMS
autonumber
actor Admin
boundary "Filament Resource/Livewire" as Filament
control "Eloquent Model\n(Article, FAQ, Gallery, dll.)" as Model
database "MySQL" as DB
collections "public storage" as Storage
collections "Laravel Cache" as Cache
boundary "Next.js Frontend" as Next
control "Laravel CmsController" as Cms

Admin -> Filament : Tambah/ubah/hapus atau moderasi konten
Filament -> Filament : Autentikasi panel dan validasi form
Filament -> Model : save()/delete()/transition
alt ada file upload
  Model -> Storage : Simpan/hapus berkas public
end
Model -> DB : INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE
DB --> Model : hasil penyimpanan
Model -> Cache : Cache::forget(key terkait)
Cache --> Model : key terhapus
Model --> Filament : hasil operasi
Filament --> Admin : notifikasi sukses/gagal

... request atau revalidation berikutnya ...
Next -> Cms : GET CMS API
Cms -> Cache : Cache::remember(key, 300)
alt cache kosong setelah invalidasi
  Cache -> DB : baca data terbaru
  DB --> Cache : data terbaru
end
Cache --> Cms : data CMS
Cms --> Next : JSON konten
note over Cache,Next
Cache::forget() tidak mengirim request ke Next.js dan tidak
memanggil on-demand revalidation. Data baru dipakai pada request/
revalidation Next.js berikutnya.
end note
@enduml
